+// way by the mc.filters reflection in actionmodern/action.c:
+//   DropShadow / Glow (type 2, 3): bit0 compositeSource, bit1 knockout, bit2 inner
+//   Bevel (type 4):    bit0 onTop, bit1 compositeSource, bit2 knockout, bit3 inner
